# main-tema-vision-cwr: the real main screen under the builtin "VISION" theme
# (big type for weak eyes: every font three sizes up through fonts_scale(), a low
# top bar, a tall frequency strip, the S-meter on a row of its own) with the mode
# in CW-R. It is main-tema-vision with the one variable UI-014 needs: the mode
# label "CW-R" (4 characters, the widest 4-character mode the radio lists) in the
# fixed 56 px cell of the top bar, whose text does not fit once VISION scales the
# fonts (the AGC cell next to it reads "AUTO" and the two peg together). Same
# radio state as home-usb-20m apart from the mode, so the only variable is the
# mode label under the scaled fonts.

name main-tema-vision-cwr
screen main

theme VISION
seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode CW-R
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
